  description: "L\xE0m th\xED nghi\u1EC7m sinh ra kh\xED \u0111\u1ED9c ho\u1EB7c m\xF9i (Cl2, NO2, H2S, HCl \u0111\u1EB7c...). Qu\u1EA1t h\xFAt kh\xED ra ngo\xE0i qua \u1ED1ng."
  usage: "K\xE9o c\u1EEDa k\xEDnh xu\u1ED1ng th\u1EA5p khi l\xE0m; kh\xF4ng th\xF2 \u0111\u1EA7u v\xE0o trong t\u1EE7."
